    "long_instructions": "# Plant Doctor: the Camera Roll\n1. In the **Images** tab, choose your **Plant Doctor** model.\n2. Make six plant images with **New image**. Choose each plant's features; the AI draws the picture from them. Make some that look healthy and some that look sick. If a picture does not match its features, draw it again.\n3. In the code, make a grid of all your images. When any image is clicked, go to **Plant Detail**.",
